  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reinforcement of the Rule of Law and Strategic Litigation in Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects activities are aimed at strategically building capacity amongst vulnerable groups and actors and through this, accompanying independent judges; supporting and accompanying judges in promoting their Associations and their right to reunion and freedom of assembly and their training. The project will also reinforce strategic litigation techniques, with the aim of increasing access to justice for vulnerable populations.</narrative>
  </description>
